y-preview-5114--base-ui.netlify.app/react/components/password-field","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5114/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5114/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4810","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4810/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4810/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4810/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4810","id":4420726038,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7aPihI","number":4810,"title":"[select][combobox][number field] Ignore hidden-input changes while readonly or disabled","user":{"login":"lunaxislu","id":102783842,"node_id":"U_kgDOBiBbYg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102783842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu","html_url":"https://github.com/lunaxislu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619567417,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio6VOQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20select","name":"component: select","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the select component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9169581687,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACIoy2dw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20combobox","name":"component: combobox","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the combobox component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-05-11T12:16:28Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T05:31:20Z","closed_at":"2026-05-18T05:31:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4810","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4810","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4810.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4810.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-18T05:31:20Z"},"body":"Fixes #4809.\n\nFollow-up to #4806.\n\n`SelectRoot` and `AriaCombobox` use the same hidden-input autofill pattern that\n`OTPFieldRoot` used before #4806, but their hidden-input `onChange` handlers\nstill only guard `defaultPrevented`, not `disabled || readOnly`.\n\nThis PR applies the same locked-state guard to those remaining handlers.\n\n`AriaCombobox` is the shared root used by:\n- `Combobox.Root` (`selectionMode='single' | 'multiple'`)\n- `Autocomplete.Root` (`selectionMode='none'`)\n\n## What changed\n\n- `SelectRoot.tsx`: hidden-input `onChange` guard now matches OTP's\n- `AriaCombobox.tsx`: same one-line guard update\n- Regression tests added for:\n  - `Select`\n  - `Combobox` (`selectionMode='single'`)\n  - `Autocomplete` (`selectionMode='none'`)\n\nEach regression test fires `change` on the hidden input and verifies that no public state change happens while `readOnly` or `disabled`.\n\nNo public API change.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4810/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4810/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4827","id":4455121902,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7b-bcK","number":4827,"title":"[otp field] Prevent locked hidden autofill validation","user":{"login":"lunaxislu","id":102783842,"node_id":"U_kgDOBiBbYg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102783842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu","html_url":"https://github.com/lunaxislu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lunaxislu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10455340405,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACby_VdQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20otp%20field","name":"component: otp field","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-15T15:39:07Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T05:40:56Z","closed_at":"2026-05-18T05:40:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4827","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4827","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4827.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4827.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-18T05:40:56Z"},"body":"<!-- Thanks so much for your PR, your contribution is appreciated! ❤️ -->\n\n- [X] I have followed (at least) the [PR section of the contributing guide](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/blob/HEAD/CONTRIBUTING.md#sending-a-pull-request).\n\nFixes #4828.\n\nFollow-up to #4806 and #4810.\n\n#4806 added a locked-state guard to OTP Field's hidden autofill input, but when the component is wrapped in `Field.Root`, the merged Field validation `onChange` can still run after the OTP Field handler returns. This can clear existing Form errors or commit validation while the field is `readOnly` or `disabled`.\n\nThis PR calls `event.preventBaseUIHandler?.()` before returning from the locked hidden-input autofill path, matching the Select, Combobox, and NumberField handling from #4810.\n\nThe tests now cover the locked-state matrix for hidden-input autofill:\n\n- `readOnly` / `disabled`\n- inside `Field.Root` / outside `Field.Root`\n\nThe outside-Field cases keep asserting that OTP Field public callbacks are not called. The inside-Field cases additionally assert that existing `Field.Error` content is preserved.\n\nVerified with:\n\n- `pnpm test:jsdom OTPField --no-watch`\n- `pnpm typescript`\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4827/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4923","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4923/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4923/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4923/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4923","id":4530800066,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7fvbSH","number":4923,"title":"[field] Remove input validation prop helper","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7205061925,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABrXSFJQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20field","name":"component: field","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the field component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8739210703,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACCOXFzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/internal","name":"internal","color":"098087","default":false,"description":"Behind-the-scenes enhancement. Formerly called “core”.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-27T08:25:59Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T09:25:51Z","closed_at":"2026-05-28T09:25:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4923","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4923","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4923.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4923.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-28T09:25:48Z"},"body":"Cleanup pass following #4911, which fixed double validation for Checkbox, Switch, and Slider. This removes the shared input-specific validation prop helper so each field-aware control validates the semantic value it owns.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Removed `getInputValidationProps` from the field validation context.\n- Moved plain string input validation into `Field.Control`.\n- Updated Select, Combobox, NumberField, and OTP hidden inputs to use validation props without a default `onChange`.\n- Added Field.Control regression tests for one on-change validation call and for clearing a prefilled required value.\n\n## Behavior note\n\n`Field.Control` now marks a prefilled required control invalid immediately when the user clears it in `validationMode=\"onChange\"`, because clearing the value is treated as a dirty user edit.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4923/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4923/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1445","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1445/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1445/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1445/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1445","id":2852913538,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs6LNASQ","number":1445,"title":"[menu] Fix prop merging issues","user":{"login":"michaldudak","id":4696105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTYxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4696105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak","html_url":"https://github.com/michaldudak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619568690,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio6aMg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20menu","name":"component: menu","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the menu component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-02-14T07:42:50Z","updated_at":"2026-05-23T14:33:28Z","closed_at":"2025-02-21T07:47:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/1445","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1445","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1445.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1445.patch","merged_at":"2025-02-21T07:47:27Z"},"body":"1. Made it possible to prevent default Base UI logic by calling `preventBaseUIHandler` in event handlers (fixes #1441) ([before](https://codesandbox.io/p/devbox/shy-fire-rpfyxk?file=%2Fsrc%2FApp.tsx%3A13%2C22&workspaceId=ws_QAeLcZEcDnfGaFA47etEUH) / [after](https://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/friendly-rgb-28p6wf?file=%2Fsrc%2FApp.tsx%3A10%2C62)).\r\n2. Fixed the behavior of disabled non-interactive triggers (i.e., `<Menu.Trigger disabled render={<span />} />`). Clicking on such a trigger used to open the menu anyway. ([before](https://codesandbox.io/p/devbox/gallant-agnesi-f98dt3?file=%2Fsrc%2FApp.tsx%3A7%2C16&workspaceId=ws_QAeLcZEcDnfGaFA47etEUH) / [after](https://codesandbox.io/p/devbox/hardcore-framework-rfxjvv?file=%2Fsrc%2FApp.tsx%3A10%2C22&workspaceId=ws_QAeLcZEcDnfGaFA47etEUH))\r\n3. Removed `mergeReactProps` calls where they were not necessary.\r\n4. Removed the `disabled` attribute from `SubmenuTrigger`. The submenus should be disabled by setting `disabled` on the Root part.\r\n5. Updated the [fully featured menu experiment](https://deploy-preview-1445--base-ui.netlify.app/experiments/menu/menu-fully-featured) to cover more cases.\r\n\r\nThe main problem in 1. was that event handlers returned from Floating UI's `useInteractions` didn't respect preventBaseUIHandler as they have their own prop merging logic.\r\nInstead of using these prop getters directly, I now call them without arguments and pass the result to our `mergeReactProps` function.\r\n\r\nAnother issue I found was that we had to nest `mergeReactProps` calls and props getters, such as `getButtonProps(mergeReactProps(external, internal))`. In some cases this was confusing and error-prone (point 2.), so I updated `mergeReactProps` to accept either props directly or a props getter function.\r\n\r\nWhen a function is provided to `mergeReactProps`, it will be called with all the props defined to the right of it, so `mergeReactProps(obj1, obj2, fn, obj3, obj4)`, will be equivalent to `mergeReactProps(obj, obj2, fn(mergeReactProps(obj3, obj4)))`.\r\nI assume that in such cases it is the props getter functionality to merge incoming and internal props and prevent default logic if needed.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1445/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1440","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1440/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1440/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1440/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1440","id":2847897234,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs6K8AEt","number":1440,"title":"[internal] Make `mergeReactProps` work with non-native event handlers","user":{"login":"michaldudak","id":4696105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTYxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4696105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak","html_url":"https://github.com/michaldudak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8739210703,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACCOXFzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/internal","name":"internal","color":"098087","default":false,"description":"Behind-the-scenes enhancement. Formerly called “core”.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-02-12T11:02:03Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T15:05:57Z","closed_at":"2025-02-13T15:13:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/1440","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1440","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1440.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1440.patch","merged_at":"2025-02-13T15:13:50Z"},"body":"Fixed the `mergeReactProps` utility to handle event handlers that don't have the event as the first parameter. It now checks if the parameter is an object and contains the `nativeEvent` field before adding the `preventBaseUIHandler` method.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I refactored the implementation to be more readable.\r\n\r\nFixes #1430","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1440/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4336","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4336/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4336/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4336/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4336","id":4077739284,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7KsWeK","number":4336,"title":"[all components] Reduce shared bundle size","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619599312,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8R0A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20enhancement","name":"type: enhancement","color":"c7def8","default":false,"description":"It’s an improvement, but we can’t make up our mind whether it's a bug fix or a new feature.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6621343510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABiqmvFg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"f9d0c4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8657577682,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACBAgm0g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/scope:%20all%20components","name":"scope: all components","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Widespread work has an impact on almost all components.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8739210703,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACCOXFzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/internal","name":"internal","color":"098087","default":false,"description":"Behind-the-scenes enhancement. Formerly called “core”.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-03-15T06:33:31Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T23:10:26Z","closed_at":"2026-03-27T06:55:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4336","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4336","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4336.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4336.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-27T06:55:05Z"},"body":"## Summary\n\nReduces shared bundle cost across the popup, focus-management, and selector paths used by many Base UI components.\n\nThis PR keeps the measurable wins from the internal `tabbable` helper and the plain-vs-memoized selector split, trims shared utility code used across popup-heavy components, and avoids the broader unverified `@base-ui/utils/store/...` import-path churn so store consumers continue to use the standard barrel entrypoint.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Replace the external `tabbable` dependency with a smaller internal helper and add focused regression coverage for shadow DOM, `details`, hidden controls, radio groups, inert content, and embedded focusable elements.\n- Split plain and memoized selector helpers so entrypoints that only need plain selectors do not pull memoized selector overhead.\n- Remove redundant non-reactive Combobox store selector subscriptions.\n- Simplify shared render, transition, animation, popup, and store utilities used across multiple components.\n\n## Notes\n\n- The latest published bundle bot result on this PR reports `@base-ui/react` down by `4.33 KB` parsed and `1.57 KB` gzip versus `master`.\n- Latest targeted perf checks in exported production builds still favor the PR head on `combobox-perf` and `select-perf`, while a Chromium `100`-slider mount check is effectively flat versus `master`.\n- Broader popup-route perf has been mixed rather than uniformly better, so this PR should be understood primarily as a shared bundle-size reduction with targeted runtime wins, not as an across-the-board popup perf improvement.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4336/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4336/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205","id":3620050614,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs6zKoAz","number":3205,"title":"[checkbox][radio][switch] Render root as `span` instead of `button`","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619568071,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio6Xxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20switch","name":"component: switch","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the switch component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6619647145,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio_MqQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20checkbox","name":"component: checkbox","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the checkbox component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6621343518,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABiqmvHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/breaking%20change","name":"breaking change","color":"A33CD6","default":false,"description":"Introduces changes that are not backward compatible.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6621343554,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABiqmvQg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20radio%20group","name":"component: radio group","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the radio group component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":15,"created_at":"2025-11-13T08:13:42Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T18:17:24Z","closed_at":"2025-11-17T09:22:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/3205","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3205.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-17T09:22:28Z"},"body":"**Breaking:** `Checkbox.Root`, `Radio.Root` and `Switch.Root` renders `<span>` instead of `<button>`\r\n\r\nLabels can't wrap both a `button` and the hidden `input` since it's [invalid HTML](https://validator.w3.org/nu/?doc=https%3A%2F%2Fbase-ui.com%2Freact%2Fcomponents%2Fradio)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"700\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-13 at 4 16 13 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/409f8525-f9a1-4a46-a524-bbd0f38e4448\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nWAVE also reports errors on the `button`:\r\n<img width=\"1000\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-17 at 3 03 02 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/faba9218-5af1-45e9-806c-bd4ab88292bd\" />\r\n\r\n- ~Clicking the label to trigger the radio/checkbox/switch doesn't work if it's a `span`, but this is added back via `Field.Label`~ actually works\r\n- HTML validator flags `aria-required` on `role=\"checkbox|switch\"` as invalid, but VO announces the required state correctly so I think it should be kept for checkbox and switch.\r\n\r\nDemos:\r\n- https://deploy-preview-3205--base-ui.netlify.app/experiments/forms/button-controls\r\n- HTML validator: https://validator.w3.org/nu/?doc=https%3A%2F%2Fdeploy-preview-3205--base-ui.netlify.app%2Freact%2Fcomponents%2Fradio\r\n\r\nAlternative to https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3203\r\n\r\n- [x] I have followed (at least) the [PR section of the contributing guide](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/blob/HEAD/CONTRIBUTING.md#sending-a-pull-request).\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3205/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1349","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1349/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1349/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1349/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1349","id":2801846464,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs6IfnSP","number":1349,"title":"[Toolbar] Add Toolbar components","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619600608,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8W4A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20new%20feature","name":"type: new feature","color":"1F7BDA","default":false,"description":"Expand the scope of the product to solve a new problem.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6621343553,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABiqmvQQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20toolbar","name":"component: toolbar","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the toolbar component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":18,"created_at":"2025-01-21T13:23:41Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T08:56:56Z","closed_at":"2025-03-18T08:56:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/1349","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1349","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1349.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/1349.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-18T08:56:48Z"},"body":"### Docs:\r\n\r\nhttps://deploy-preview-1349--base-ui.netlify.app/react/components/toolbar\r\n\r\n### Demos:\r\n- https://deploy-preview-1349--base-ui.netlify.app/experiments/toolbar/basic\r\n- https://deploy-preview-1349--base-ui.netlify.app/experiments/toolbar/text-editor\r\n- https://deploy-preview-1349--base-ui.netlify.app/experiments/toolbar/triggers\r\n\r\n### Summary\r\n- [x] parts: `Root`, `Button`, `Input`, `Link`, `Group`, `Separator`\r\n- [x] `focusableWhenDisabled` prop on `Button` & `Input`\r\n- [x] `orientation` prop\r\n- [x] roving focus, `loop` prop\r\n- [x] ~hotkey prop on Root~ https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/1454\r\n- [x] grid layout with `cols` prop\r\n\r\n### Component integrations\r\nThe three demos linked above show all of these:\r\n- [x] Dialog/AlertDialog\r\n- [x] Menu\r\n- [x] Menu with submenu\r\n- [x] Popover\r\n- [x] Select\r\n- [x] Toggle/ToggleGroup\r\n- [x] Tooltip\r\n- [x] NumberField using `Toolbar.Input`\r\n- [x] DirectionProvider\r\n- [x] ~~Input~~ this will be a `Toolbar.Input` instead\r\n- [x] Switch\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/661\r\n\r\n- [x] I have followed (at least) the [PR section of the contributing guide](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/blob/HEAD/CONTRIBUTING.md#sending-a-pull-request).\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1349/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/1349/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}